==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|jog|er|lang=en}}, one who [[jogs]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdʒɒ.ɡə(ɹ)/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈdʒɑːɡɚ/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɒɡə(r)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person who [[jog]]s (as exercise).
# A [[tracksuit]], particularly the [[trousers]].
# A [[printing press]] operator who removes, jogs, and stacks the [[sheet]]s or [[signature]]s of paper.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|tracksuit}}, {{l|en|joggers}}

